== (b) two nested calls for every 2 x 2 reflection, as a polynomial identity modulo c^2 + s^2 = 1
identity holds for the four unit tables, hence for every table and every reflection (c, s on the circle, any field): True
A sz A = [[{(2, 0): Fraction(2, 1), (0, 0): Fraction(-1, 1)}, {(1, 1): Fraction(2, 1)}], [{(1, 1): Fraction(2, 1)}, {(0, 0): Fraction(1, 1), (2, 0): Fraction(-2, 1)}]]  (c^2 - s^2 = 2c^2 - 1 and 2cs: the reflection at twice the angle)
glue gates (G): 4 before (two butterflies) + 4 after; calls: 2 x 2 gates; total 12, against 4 calls x 2 gates = 8 for rows-then-columns
